<title>LATVIA: SAULES BANK MOSCOW REP LICENSE PROLONGED.</title>
<headline>SAULES BANK MOSCOW REP LICENSE PROLONGED.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saules Bank, one of Latvia's leading banks, said on Wednesday that the Russian central bank had prolonged its Moscow rep office accreditation until the year 2000.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement that its rep office license was good until August 15, 2000.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
